<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- LYN55.USFM K.KACHINDA NT 1TIMOTY</book>
  <para style="h">Timoteya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Eliñolo no matatekelo lya Paulusi kwa Timoteya</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timoteya</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tmy</para>
  <para style="mt2">Elin̄olo lya Paulusi no weli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt">TIMOTEYA</para>
  <para style="imt">Okulimukisa</para>
  <para style="ip">Ebuka ya Timoteya no weli ni lin̄olo linakun̄oliwa okutunda kwa mutumiwa Paulusi okuta ku mwiyeti waye Timoteya. Timoteya no weli mwendi kame lina kun̄oliwa mu myaka makumi mutanu ni limweya ni twiili okutwala ku makumi mutanu ni limweya ni tunee (62-64 AD) munyima no kufa kwa Jesu. Esi kame simonahala okutendahala beebi ni mamaneneno no upilo wa Paulusi. Paulusi kame ano kulema esilikani sinene ni Timoteya mane enako no kupula kame ana ku mwisananga nji mwanaye (Filipi 2.22; 1 Timoteya 1.2; 1.18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Eli ni limweya ku man̄olo anee atunda kwa Paulusi ao ana yuleke ku munu kasa ku Keleke. Aman̄olo aatu anjili ni Timoteya no wiili, Tite, mane ni Filimoni. Timoteya no weli kame likwite onene etitaba no titaelo ba kulumbeka Keleke (2.1-15), etiswanelo no aendisi mu Keleke (3.1-13), mi etitemuso kweyi no aiyeti no mapwa (1.3-11; 4.1-5; 6.2-5). Esi kame simonisa Paulusi omo naiyetetanga Timoteya okutenda omwendisi mukaci no tikeleke. Timoteya weli kame lili ni milao no kupula eyo itwesa okutusa aendisi no tikeleke mu maywaa etu oku babalela eketelelo no tikeleke na mwibaka yetu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Emitwi no titaba</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulusi kame atateka muku keeta Timoteya (1.1-2).</para>
  <para style="io1">Cwale kame aba Timoteya emamela mulibka no aiyeti no mapwa (1.3-11).</para>
  <para style="io1">Kame Paulusi kame aekeza okutoloka okutumela kwaye kwa Jesu Kilesite (1.12-19).</para>
  <para style="io1">Esisitatama kame a laela Timoteya mulibaka no milumbeko mane ni aendisi no Keleke (2-3).</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulusi kame amanenena elin̄olo lyaye mukuba Timoteya eti taelo no mamaneneno (4-6).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1"/>
  <para style="s">Okukeeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1"/>Mene Paulusi, Omutumiwa wa Jesu Kilesite, mutaelo ya Nyambe omuyo yisi wetu, neyi ya Jesu Kilesite esepo yetu.<verse eid="1TI 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2"/>Kame nin̄olela Timoteya, mwanange luli mu tumelo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">Esishemo, amakeke ni kozo okutunda kwa Nyambe Sitetu, ni kwa Kilesite Jesu Ombumu wetu.<verse eid="1TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Emamela okulwisa Etituto no Mapwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3"/>Kanyi omo nina kukwambelela aba nina kuta ku Masedonia, nji osiyale mu Efese nji cwale olemuse aanu anjili nji alese okwiyeta etuto indina, <verse eid="1TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4"/>simba alese okubeeka onyene ku matangu ni ku masika no kwaabwa , awo alita etin̄ananyi, mi katusu omunjili okutenda omusebezi wa Nyambe owo otwesiwa okutendiwa konji fela mu tumelo. <verse eid="1TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5"/>Elibaka no taelo eyo, ninji wiikale ni lilato eli litunda mu mucima no kukena, ni mu lizwalo no kuwaba, ni ku tumelo no niti. <verse eid="1TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6"/>Aanu anjili kame anatundu kweeyo mi kame anati ku myambelo nambulwa tuso. <verse eid="1TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7"/>Kame alakaza nji atende aiyeti no mulawo kono kayupisisa eyo aamba simba einu eyi yaa ongota.<verse eid="1TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etuso no Mulao wa Mushe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8"/>Cwale kame tuyii nji omulawo niwakuwaba, nji omunu kame akutusisa wo mu kufanena. <verse eid="1TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9"/>Okuyupisisa eyi, ninji omulawo kausi sitendelwa aanu no kuluka, kono kame usumenwe awo nokwiiba nawo akana okuyupa, naa akana etitaba ta Nyambe, nawo asikutenda eibi, nawo no kwakena, naa asikushwaula, naa anaibaa asitoo, nawo anaibaa ainaoo, naa aibaa aanu, <verse eid="1TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10"/>kame usumenwe ni mahule awo atenda naakoo alume, ni asodoma, naa aulisa aanu, naa no mapwa, naa akununga amapwa, nawo asikukana etuto no niti. <verse eid="1TI 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11"/>okukumanena ni liywi no kuwaba no kanya ya Nyambe no kufuyaulwa woyo olumbekiwa, elyo ni beekilwe mu pabalelo yalyo.<verse eid="1TI 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okutumela ku Makeke a Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12"/>Kame nikutumelo kwa Jesu Kilesite Ombumu wetu, woyo onanibi amaata no musebezi wange. Kakuli nanimono okusepahala okuniketa mu musebezi waye <verse eid="1TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13"/>simba nji kame nina kumunyefula, okumuyandisa mane ni kumwangola. Kono kame ina shemubiwa, kakuli kame nina kutenda eyo mu kwalimuka, me kani sipumena. <verse eid="1TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14"/>Cwale esishemo sa Mbumu wetu kame sinaiyi kwa mene onene ni tumelo ni lilato eli liliko mwa Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="1TI 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15"/>Omwambelo niwa niti mane ni kutambuliwa luli, nji Kilesite Jesu nakwiiya mu litunga mu kuyoyisa asikutenda eibi. Mi kwa onyene awo asikutenda eibi time nakuuso, <verse eid="1TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16"/>kono kame nina tambula esishemo mulibaka eli nji mwa mene woyo na kuuso nji, Jesu Kilesite amonise omucima waye no kuwaba mi kutendiwe omwanda kwawo sa lumele mwa yonyene nji abiwe omoyo no kwaabwa. <verse eid="1TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17"/>Kwa Mbumu no kuta oku nokwaabwa, no kwaafa, no kwa monwa, yonyene Nyambe yomboci, abiwe elikute ni kanya mu tinako ni tinako Ameni.<verse eid="1TI 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18"/>Etaelo eyi kame niibeeka kwa wene Timoteya mwanange okukumanena nanuhi anakwamba mulibaka lyowe. Mwa onyene, ote nayo mi olwe endwa no kuwaba, <verse eid="1TI 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19"/>mi oikale ni tumelo ni lizwalo no kuwaba. Mukulesela elizwalo no kuwaba aanu anjili nasinyehelwe elizwalo lyoo ni tumelo yoo. <verse eid="1TI 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20"/>Kwa onyene kame kuli Himeniyasi ni Alekizanda, awo ninabi kwa Satani nji aiyetiwe okwanyefula.<verse eid="1TI 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Okulumbeka Mu Keleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1"/>Cwale oweli kame ni myambela nji, etitapelo, okukumbela, okulapelela ni witumelo itendiwe kwaanu onje, <verse eid="1TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2"/>kakuli ambumu nawo ali ba itulo no kukutekeha, nji tuyoye muukuketa ni moyo no kozo mu ulapeli ni likute mu mikwa yonje. <verse eid="1TI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3"/>Kakuli esi nisa kuwaba ni kupumeniwa mu miyo a Nyambe omuyoyisi wetu, <verse eid="1TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4"/>woyo osinga nji aanu onje ayoyisiwe ni kukeela ba kulimuka eniti. <verse eid="1TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5"/>Kakuli kame kuli Nyambe mumweya feela, mi kame kuli omwimaneni mumweya woyo oli mukaci no aanu ni Nyambe yonyene Kilesite Jesu omulume, <verse eid="1TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6"/>woyo ona kukuba yonyene etifo no aanu onje. Oupaki ona kubiwa mu nako no niti, <verse eid="1TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7"/>kakuli sokame eso ina ketelwe okutenda omwiyeti ni mutumiwa kame naamba eniti mi kanoongo, meene omwiyeti no asimacaba mu tumelo ni niti.<verse eid="1TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akati kame Afanena Okupumeniwa Okwiyeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8"/>Kame ni lakaza cwale nji mu sibaka sonje aanu alapele, aimekile amaoko no kukena okuulwile okutina ni tin̄ananyi. <verse eid="1TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9"/>Kame ni singa nji akati onyene akufuke wino nuukukabisa mu kumonahala kasa ni tin̄uki nokwa monahala wino simba egauda, simba etipelela simba eikumango no kutula, <verse eid="1TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10"/>Kono ni misebezi no kuwaba kanyi akati alukele awo alapela Nyambe. <verse eid="1TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11"/>Mulesele akati akwiyete mu kondoka akubeekile kunji mu ukukokobezo no kwiyala mwa Nyambe. <verse eid="1TI 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12"/>Silumele nji omukati aiyete simba okwikala ni maata beulu no alume, kono kame afanena akondoke. <verse eid="1TI 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13"/>Kakuli Adama yona kuumbiwa oweli, okubinda Eba munyima. <verse eid="1TI 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14"/>Cwale Adama kasa yonyene ona kongiwa, kono omukati yona kongiwa mane sebeli ocola omulawo wa Nyambe. <verse eid="1TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15"/>Cwale omukati mbayoyiswa mukuleya aana, nji yotwalelelela mu tumelo ni lilato, niukukenisa nuukulema.<verse eid="1TI 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Aendisi Namu Keleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1"/>Omwambelo niwaniti, nji omunu yonje aba alakaza okwingena ba wiyeti, kame alakaza omusebezi no kuwaba. <verse eid="1TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2"/>Cwale omwiyeti aulwe esi sinyazahala mwa yonyene, atende omulume no mukati mumweya, atende woyo no ukulema, nuukuteka, woyo osikutambula angenda, woyo otwesa okwiyeta aanu, <verse eid="1TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3"/>kasa osikunwa onene eyi ikolwisa, woyo osikufula aanu, simba woyo no kusinga onene amali, <verse eid="1TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4"/>kame afanena okubusa wino asindoo yaye, okuyupiwa kwanaye mane niku kutekeha mu mukwa onje. <verse eid="1TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5"/>Kakuli omunu aba aulwa okulimuka okubusa wino asindoo yaye, ngasibine satwese okubabalela Endoo ya Nyambe ya Nyambe? <verse eid="1TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6"/>Alese okutenda omunu woyo otangisa okupumena, simba ofanena oukukuhumusa mane akwele mu katulo ya Diyabulozi. <verse eid="1TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7"/>Kame afanena oku pakiwa wino kwaanu awo ali kundee, nji alese okukwela mukunyaziwa ni mu mukwa wa Diyabulozi.<verse eid="1TI 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Atusi namu Keleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8"/>Atusi no keleke ni onyene atende ano kutukufalelwa, kasa asitindimi timbili, asikunwa onene amalopu mane nikusinga onene amali <verse eid="1TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9"/>atundamene mu tumelo no niti ni lizwalo no kukena. <verse eid="1TI 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10"/>Cwale kame afanena okwetekiwa oweli, nji cwale kaanyazahala asebeze kanyi atusi no keleke. <verse eid="1TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11"/>Naakati ngeso atukufalelwe, alese okutenda asikooba, kono akuleme mane niku sepahala mu inu yonje. <verse eid="1TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12"/>Atusi no keleke atende omulume no mukati mumweya mane asikubabalela wino anoo nasindo yoo. <verse eid="1TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13"/>Kakuli awo asebeza wino kanyi atusi no keleke mbakuwana elikute no kuwaba mane ngeso ni koongola mu tumelo eyo ili mwa Kilesite Jesu.<verse eid="1TI 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ekunutu no Kuneneba no Unyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14"/>Kame nisinga okwiiya kwa wene abano, kono kame nikun̄olela etitaelo eti nji cwale, <verse eid="1TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15"/>nji kame niliyeha, mufanene okulimuka omo omunu afanena okwikalela mu ndoo ya Nyambe eyo itendile nji keleke ya Nyambe no kuyoya omusumo ni matatekelo no niti. <verse eid="1TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16"/>Omunene luli woyo tupumena no kuneneba mu tumelo yetu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Naku monahala mu unu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">kame anatendiwa woyo no kuluka ku mebo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">kame ana kumoniwa ku mangeloi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">kame ana kukutaziwa mukaci no aanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">kame ana kutumeniwa mu litunga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">mane nakushimbeliwa mu kanya.<verse eid="1TI 3:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4"/>
  <para style="s">Ayeti no Mapwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1"/>Cwale Emebo kame yaamba mu koongola nji mu tinako na kuuso anjili mbatundu mu tumelo, okukumalela emebo no mapwa mane ni tituto no madimona. <verse eid="1TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2"/>Etituto eti kame titunda kwasikukuba no mapwa awo amazwalo oo nababuliwa. <verse eid="1TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3"/>Ao akanisa aanu okukwata ni kulya eilya eyo ana umbu Nyambe nji itambuliwe muukutumela kwawo apumena ni kulimuka eniti. <verse eid="1TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4"/>Kakuli einu yonje ina kumbiwa kwa Nyambe niya kuwaba, mi kakwisa eyo ikaniwa nji kame itambuliwa muukutumela, <verse eid="1TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5"/>kakuli kame ikenisiwa yonje ni liywi lya Nyambe ni tapelo.<verse eid="1TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omubika no Kuwaba wa Kilesite Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6"/>Nji kame obeeka etitaelo eto balubala no aasikupumena, mbutende omubika nokuwaba wa Kilesite Jesu, woyo onakulele ba liywi no tumelo ni mu tuto no kuwaba eyo onakon̄o. <verse eid="1TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7"/>Olese okutenda esinjili ni milimu mane ni matangu. Oku twaete mu musebezi no ulapeli. <verse eid="1TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8"/>Kakuli okutwaeza olutu emisebezi kame kutusa mbicani, kono ounyambe kame otusa mu inu yonje owo onabiwi esepiso no omoyo wa bano mane nowo osiiya. <verse eid="1TI 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9"/>Omwambelo owo niwa niti mi otambuliwe mu kwiyala. <verse eid="1TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10"/>Kakuli kumamaneneno ano kame tuyanda ni kusebeza kakuli kame tubekile esepo yetu mwa Nyambe wetu no kuyoya, Omuyoyisi no aanu onje onene kwawo apumena.<verse eid="1TI 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11"/>Olaele mane oiyete einu eyi kwaanu <verse eid="1TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12"/>Kuulwe omunu woyo sosinya oundumbana wowe, kono otenda omwanda mu kwamba ni oukulema, mu lilato, mu tumelo mane nimu kukena. <verse eid="1TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13"/>Okutwala aba saniyele, oikale kwaanu meubala aman̄olo okukutaza ni kwiiyeta. <verse eid="1TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14"/>Olese oku keshebisa empo eyo okwite eyo onakubiwa mu unuhi abo esikwata no akulu aba anakukubeeka amaoko oo beulu yowe. <verse eid="1TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15"/>Otokomele emisebezi eyi, okubeeke wenyene ku yonyene nji cwale aanu onje amone okutukufalelwa kowe. <verse eid="1TI 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16"/>Okutokomele wenyene mane otokomele ni tuto yowe. Otwalelelela mo kakuli mukutenda ngeso mbuku yoyisa mane bamweya nawo akuyupa.<verse eid="1TI 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5"/>
  <para style="s">Etitukelo no Alumeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1"/>Olese okwayuta omukulu kono omususuweze kanyi sitowe, obabalele andumbana kanyi ainowe, <verse eid="1TI 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2"/>obabalele akulu no akati kanyi ainawowe, obabalele akatana kanyi amandowe mu kukena monje,<verse eid="1TI 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3"/>Okuteke akati no timbelwa awo atendile ambelwa luli. <verse eid="1TI 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4"/>Nji ombelwa kame ali naana simba aikulyaye, mwalesele akwiyete oweli oulapeli woo ku lubasi loo mi anjili mwause kwashemi oo, kakuli esi sokame eso silumelelwa mu miyo a Nyambe. <verse eid="1TI 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5"/>Cwale ombelwa no niti mi nasiyala yomboci mu umweya, mi kame atwalelela mu kukumbela ni kulapela omunji ni usiku. <verse eid="1TI 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6"/>Kono woyo okuyoyela mu minyaka, nafu naaba ayoya. <verse eid="1TI 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7"/>Walaele eyi, nji cwale aulwe naaba anyazahala. <verse eid="1TI 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8"/>Nji omunu yonje kababalele aabaye, onene asindoo yaye kame ana kana etumelo, mi kame abitiwa ku munu no kwapumena.<verse eid="1TI 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etimbelwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9"/>Ombelwa kame afanena okun̄oliwa mu buka no timbelwa nji nabitelele emyaka makumi atanu ni likumi limweya no kuleiwa. Woyo ona kukwaliwa ku mulume mumweya feela, <verse eid="1TI 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10"/>mi kame afanena okupakiwa wino ku misebezi yaye no kuwaba, oku lela aana, oku tambula angenda, oku yowisa amakondo no anu a Mbumu, okutusa aakalelwe, mane nukubeeka yonyene okutenda wino mu mikwa yonje.<verse eid="1TI 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11"/>Kono okane okun̄ola etimbelwa no akatana, kakuli aba akula mu minyaka kame atunda kwa Kilesite mane kame alakaza okukwaliwa, <verse eid="1TI 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12"/>mi kame akwingenyeka mu mubonda aba acola esepiso yoo no weli. <verse eid="1TI 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13"/>Kame akwiyeta okububa aba apota pota mu tindoo, mi kasa kububa feela kono ni kooba mane nikupateha etinyutu too, ni kwamba einu nambulwa tuso. <verse eid="1TI 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14"/>Cwale kame nisinga nji etimbelwa no akatana tikwaliwe, aleye aana, ababalele asitindoo too mane alese okuba esiila esibaka no kwamba eyi no kwiiba kwaaci. <verse eid="1TI 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15"/>Kakuli etimbelwa tinjili sebeli tafutukela kale kwa Satani. <verse eid="1TI 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16"/>Nji omuasi kupumena no mukati kame ali naabaye no timbelwa, aatuse, keleke ilese okwimelwa nji cwale keleke yonyene ituse etimbelwa nambulwa awo aatusa.<verse eid="1TI 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aakulu no Keleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17"/>Mulesele akulu awo aendisa wino, atenekiwe twiili onene awo sebeza mu kukutaza ni kwiyeta eliywi. <verse eid="1TI 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18"/>Kakuli elin̄olo kame lyamba nji, “Mulese okununga opulu kukanwa aba ashenga oubeke” mane, “Woyo osebeza kame afaneniwa omupuzo waye.” <verse eid="1TI 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19"/>Olese okutambula etaba eyi ilwisa omukulu no keleke, konji aba ibihiwa kwapaki ayiili simba aatu. <verse eid="1TI 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20"/>Kwawo atenda esiibi, waakalimele balubala no aanu onje nji cwale anjili acile.<verse eid="1TI 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21"/>Balubala lwa Nyambe ni lwa Kilesite Jesu mane ni balubala no man̄eloi aketilwe kame ni kulaela okumamela emilao eyi me ulwile esaluluti okutenda esinjili ni sobozi. <verse eid="1TI 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22"/>Olese okuleluba okubeeka amaoko baanu simba oukubeeka mu sibi no akowe, kono wene okukenise.<verse eid="1TI 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23"/>Olese okunwanga feela ameyi, kono okutusisange ni waine icana mulibaka no lipumo lyowe ni kukola-kola kowe no kulemenena.<verse eid="1TI 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24"/>Eibi no aanu anjili kame imonahala wino muwangu-wangu simba ba nako no katulo, kono eibi no anjili kame saimonahale munyima aba sakubite enako. <verse eid="1TI 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25"/>Cwale yongeeso ni ku misebezi no kuwaba kame imonahala, simba nji kaimonahala, kono kaitamba kusiyalela eishweekilwe.<verse eid="1TI 5:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1"/>Awo ali munji no coko no ubika alikete aolyoo mukwakuteka onene, nji cwale elitina lya Nyambe ni tuto yetu ilese okwambiwa esi no kwiiba. <verse eid="1TI 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2"/>Awo aluwilwe kwa olyoo no aasikupumena aabe elikute nji nonyene nasikupumena, asebeze wino kakuli awo asebelezwa nonyene niaasikupumena nasingiwa, mwiyete ni kutokomela emisebezi eyi.<verse eid="1TI 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etuto no mapwa ni ufumu no niti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3"/>Nji omunu kame aiyeta mi kalumelelana ni maywi no niti a Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite ni tuto eyo ilumelelana ni ulapeli <verse eid="1TI 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4"/>woyo kame akukuumusa mi kakwisa eso alimukile. Kame atomine mu minahano yoo mi kame asinga okutenda etin̄ananyi ba maywi, eto tilita omuna, okwayuta, etingangu mane ni mihupulo no kwiiba, <verse eid="1TI 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5"/>mi kame ali ni tin̄ananyi mukaci no aanu ni kunahana eyi no kwiiba mane nikuulwa eniti. Kame ahupula nji oulapeli endila no kufuma.<verse eid="1TI 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6"/>Kame kuli esifumu no kuneneba mu ulapeli, nji kame tukolwa kweyo tuli nayo. <verse eid="1TI 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7"/>Kakuli kakwisa esi tuna liti mu litunga mi katutwese okushimba esinjili mu litunga aba tulisiya. <verse eid="1TI 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8"/>Kono nji kame tuli ni ilya ni ikumango, yatusepa eyeyo. <verse eid="1TI 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9"/>Kono awo alakaza okufuma kame akwela mu muliko, mu malaba, neyi isinya, mane eyi itikiseta aanu mukusinyeha ni kutaukelela. <verse eid="1TI 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10"/>Kakuli okusinga onene amali, endila eyo itwala ku uyiii onje. Aanu anjili mukusinga amali, natundu mu tumelo yoo mane kame acola emicima yoo mu mayando no kupula.<verse eid="1TI 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etitaelo no Mamaneneno Kwa Timoteya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11"/>Kono kwa wene, omunu wa Nyambe, otunde kweyi yonje. Otwalelelela mu kuluka, mu ulapeli, mu tumelo, ni lilato, mu ukukoongota ni ukuketa. <verse eid="1TI 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12"/>Olwe endwaa no kuwaba no tumelo, oleme omoyo no kwaabwa ou onaisanenwe aba ona kwamba eyi no tumelo yowe balubala no apaki no kupula. <verse eid="1TI 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13"/>Balubala lwa Nyambe woyo oba omoyo ku inu yonje ni balubala lwa Kilesite Jesu woyo no paka eyi no tumelo yaye balubala lwa Pontiyasi Pilato woyo ona kutenda oupaki no kuwaba. <verse eid="1TI 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14"/>kame ni kulaela nji omamele etaelo eyo mane kuulwe neso sinyazahala mwa wene okutwala abo sa kamona halele Ombumu wetu Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="1TI 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15"/>Cwale esi mbasi monahala ba nako ilukeele kwa Nyambe ona fuyaulwa Omubusi yomboci, Ombumu no ambumu onje. <verse eid="1TI 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16"/>Yonyene yomboci no kwaafa mi kame ayoya mu liseli elyo kakwisa omunu otwesa okushetetako, woyo kakwisa onamumono mane kakwisa woyo omumona. Kwa yonyene kwikale elikute ni maata no kwaabwa! Ameni.<verse eid="1TI 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17"/>Kwawo aluwile muno mu litunga waabe emamela nji alese oukukuumusa simba okubeeka esepo yoo ku ufumu nambulwa tuso kono asepe Nyambe woyo otuba oufumu mukupula nikutu fuyola okutuba einu yonje tukukola. <verse eid="1TI 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18"/>Asebeze eyi no kuwaba, okufuma mu misebezi no kuwaba, awo aba ni mucima mumweya. <verse eid="1TI 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19"/>Mu kutenda ngeso kame akutewela onyene okutenda omusumo no kuwaba na kuuso nji cwale alimuke omoyo no niti luli.<verse eid="1TI 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20"/>Weene Timoteya oteule eyo ibekilwe mu pabalelo yowe. Otunde mu yambo nambulwa tuso eyo no mapwa nji ezibo. <verse eid="1TI 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21"/>Anjili mu kupaka, cwale mukutenda ngeso kame ana tundu mu tumelo yoo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Esishemo siikale niwene.<verse eid="1TI 6:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6"/>
</usx>
